msgstr "**API HOST:** O endereço do servidor que hospeda o Stealth (ex: https://x.x.x.x:8448)"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/stealth.rst:29
msgid ""
"**USERNAME:** A username for the portaladmin, or the user who logs into "
